    affiliation: Norwegian Institute of Public Health
abstract: >-
  Supplementary Materials, with the Stata code and output used to produce
  them, describing a simulation study comparing candidate analysis
  strategies for a cluster-randomized trial in which some participants
  randomized to the intervention could not receive it, and the
  application of the chosen strategy to a fictitious trial dataset.
